        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/7/x/temple-bar-dublin-wp/vertical-street-level.jpg",
          "filename": "Rainy day at Merchant's Arch, Temple Bar, Dublin.jpg",
          "caption": "A vertical street-level photograph looking through Merchant's Arch toward the Temple Bar district in Dublin, Ireland. The narrow, cobblestone alleyway is bustling with pedestrians navigating a heavy rain shower, many using umbrellas (notably a bright red one in the center). The scene features numerous shop signs and neon lights, including \"Golly Gosh Vintage Boutique,\" \"Hanley's Cornish Pasties,\" and \"The Merchant's Arch\" pub. The wet pavement reflects the ambient light from the shops and street lamps, creating a moody, atmospheric urban landscape.",
          "alt": "A vertical street-level photograph looking through Merchant's Arch toward the Temple Bar district in Dublin, Ireland. The narrow, cobblestone alleyway is bustling with pedestrians navigating a heavy rain shower, many using umbrellas (notably a bright red one in the center). The scene features numerous shop signs and neon lights, including \"Golly Gosh Vintage Boutique,\" \"Hanley's Cornish Pasties,\" and \"The Merchant's Arch\" pub. The wet pavement reflects the ambient light from the shops and street lamps, creating a moody, atmospheric urban landscape.",
